urce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149710/extras/af063336ece01bba367bb45328757c93.webm?t=1630342693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149710/extras/af063336ece01bba367bb45328757c93.mp4?t=1630342693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose your own path through the corrupted lands, and bear the responsibilities of your choices. The world is procedurally generated offering a unique adventure each and every time!",
